00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:30.800
..

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.833
Aku juga... aku juga...

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:44.600
...

00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:49.700
Jangan dipikirkan.

00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:53.266
Tapi...

00:02:01.733 --> 00:02:04.800
Ayo kita ikut konseling.

00:02:26.466 --> 00:02:44.433
